# API Server URL
# ================

# LOCAL ACCESS (from this PC only):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5001
# VITE_EDGE_URL=http://localhost:5001

# NETWORK ACCESS (from any device in local network):
# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.1.92:5001
# VITE_EDGE_URL=http://192.168.1.92:5001

# INTERNET ACCESS (via ngrok tunnel):
# Get your ngrok URL from: start_ngrok_tunnel.bat
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-tunnel.ngrok-free.app
# VITE_EDGE_URL=https://your-api-tunnel.ngrok-free.app

# ================
# ACTIVE CONFIG (uncomment ONE set above and comment others)
# ================
